; A small, well-kept set of books.
;
; Format:  DATE [flag] "description"
;            ACCOUNT            AMOUNT CURRENCY
;            ACCOUNT           -AMOUNT CURRENCY
;
; Postings are indented and must sum to zero. A balance assertion checks the
; running balance of an account on a date.

2026-01-01 * "Opening balances"
  Assets:Bank:Checking       2500.00 USD
  Assets:Cash                 120.00 USD
  Equity:Opening            -2620.00 USD

2026-01-03 * "January rent"
  Expenses:Rent              1200.00 USD
  Assets:Bank:Checking      -1200.00 USD

2026-01-07 * "Groceries"
  Expenses:Food                86.40 USD
  Assets:Bank:Checking        -86.40 USD

2026-01-15 * "Salary"
  Assets:Bank:Checking       3200.00 USD
  Income:Salary             -3200.00 USD

2026-01-20 * "Groceries on the card"
  Expenses:Food               150.00 USD
  Liabilities:Card           -150.00 USD

2026-01-31 balance Assets:Bank:Checking = 4413.60 USD
